{"title":"Mock AIME","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>Mock AIME</b> is a contest that is intended to mimic the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME</a> competition. (In more recent years, recurring competitions will be listed under the range of their respective competition season, whereas non-recurring competitions will be listed in the year of their release.)\n</p><p>The user <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/user/167643\">parmenides51</a> created an organized collection of all (or mostly all) AIME mocks in this page <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c2439872_aime_mocks\">here</a> in the AoPS community. Many original problem and solution files of the mocks are compiled <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c594864h3441744_77_amc_10_41_amc_12_and_other_mocks_compiled_in_google_drive_folder\">here</a>. Those files are also located <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1z9HjOdavlDQVpzjPOR98Q8p63Iy84LJI\">here</a>, categorized based on whether or not they have solutions.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Pre 2006\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://services.artofproblemsolving.com/download.php?id=YXR0YWNobWVudHMvZC84Lzc1Njc5NjQwNjM1ZWU4MTI5NWZiMDIxOGY2Y2QwOTc3NWZiYjY0LnBkZg==&amp;rn=TWlsZG9yZiBNb2NrIEFJTUUucGRm\">Mildorf Mock AIME 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_7_Pre_2005\" title=\"Mock AIME 7 Pre 2005\"> Mildorf Mock AIME 5 (chronologically, the 7th Mock AIME Pre 2005)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5h63721p380055\">beta Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Mock_AIME_5_Pre_2005\">Silverfalcon Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Mock_AIME_6_Pre_2005\">paladin8 Mock AIME</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2006 - 2007\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 1 2006-2007</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 2 2006-2007</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_3_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 3 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 3 2006-2007</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_4_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 4 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 4 2006-2007</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 5 2006-2007</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_6_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 6 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 6 2006-2007</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_7_2006-2007\" title=\"Mock AIME 7 2006-2007\">Mock AIME 7 2006-2007</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2007 - 2008\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2007-2008\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2007-2008\">Mock AIME 1 2007-2008</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2010\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_1_2010\" title=\"Mock AIME 1 2010\">Mock AIME 1 2010</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_2_2010\" title=\"Mock AIME 2 2010\">Mock AIME 2 2010</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2011\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_I_2011\" title=\"Mock AIME I 2011\">Mock AIME I 2011</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_Geometry_AIME_2011\" title=\"Mock Geometry AIME 2011\">Mock Geometry AIME 2011</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2012\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_I_2012\" title=\"Mock AIME I 2012\">Mock AIME I 2012</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_II_2012\" title=\"Mock AIME II 2012\">Mock AIME II 2012</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry_Mock_AIME_2012\" title=\"Geometry Mock AIME 2012\">Geometry Mock AIME 2012</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2013\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_I_2013\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mock AIME I 2013\">Mock AIME I 2013</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ASIA_TEAM_(Mock_AIME_II_2013)\" title=\"ASIA TEAM (Mock AIME II 2013)\">ASIA TEAM (Mock AIME II 2013)</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2014\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northeastern_WOOTers_Mock_AIME_I\" title=\"Northeastern WOOTers Mock AIME I\">Northeastern WOOTers Mock AIME I</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northeastern_WOOTers_Mock_AIME_II\" title=\"Northeastern WOOTers Mock AIME II\">Northeastern WOOTers Mock AIME II</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c594864h2991378\">Triple Mock AIME I, II, and III</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c594864h602645\">Binomial-theorem/djmathman Mock AIME</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>2015\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5t51970f5h1062581_2015_mock_aime_ii_test_released\">mathtastic Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5t51970f5h1061913_2015_mock_aime_ii\">henrikjb Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5h1065109_2015_mock_aime_ii\">DVA6102 Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5t183f5h1074599_trumpeters_mock_aime\">Trumpeter's Mock AIME</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5h1087167_mock_jaime\">May Mock JAIME (Junior AIME)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" cla